iv class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"grop-filter_content_warp grop-prjt-page\">\n      <!-- Project Filter -->\n              <div id=\"grop_filters\" class=\"text-left grop-projctfilter_nav\">\n          <ul class=\"text-uppercase list-inline\">\n      \t\t\t<li class=\"grop-filte_btn is-active\" data-filter=\"*\">Show All</li>\n            <li class=\"grop-filte_btn cat-category-2\" data-filter=\".category-2\" title=\"가정법\">가정법</li><li class=\"grop-filte_btn cat-category-3\" data-filter=\".category-3\" title=\"고용과 근로\">고용과 근로</li><li class=\"grop-filte_btn cat-category-4\" data-filter=\".category-4\" title=\"사회보장과 복지\">사회보장과 복지</li><li class=\"grop-filte_btn cat-category-8\" data-filter=\".category-8\" title=\"유언장과 위임장\">유언장과 위임장</li><li class=\"grop-filte_btn cat-category-5\" data-filter=\".category-5\" title=\"이민법\">이민법</li><li class=\"grop-filte_btn cat-category-1\" data-filter=\".category-1\" title=\"주택임대차법\">주택임대차법</li><li class=\"grop-filte_btn cat-category-7\" data-filter=\".category-7\" title=\"학대와 가정폭력\">학대와 가정폭력</li><li class=\"grop-filte_btn cat-category-6\" data-filter=\".category-6\" title=\"형법\">형법</li>      \t\t</ul>\n        </div>\n      \n      <!-- Project Start -->\n      <div class=\"grop-filter_content  grop-projctfilter_content\" data-restored-grid=\"\">\n\n                <div class=\"grop-filter_single_col  grop-projctfilter_col bpw-col-2 category-6 \">\n          <div class=\"grop-projct_itm_warp\">\n            <!--project Media box start \\-->\n            <div class=\"grop-projct_media_box\">\n              <a class=\"grop-cause_media_img\" href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EC%A0%95%EC%8B%A0%EA%B1%B4%EA%B0%95-%EB%B0%8F-%EC%95%BD%EB%AC%BC%EC%B9%98%EB%A3%8C%2Findex.html\">\n                <img src=\"./archive/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/%EC%A0%95%EC%8B%A0%EA%B1%B4%EA%B0%95-360x234.jpg\" alt=\"정신건강 및 약물치료\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              </a>\n\n            </div><!--/end-->\n\n            <!--project content text start \\-->\n            <div class=\"grop-projct_content_warp\">\n              <h4>\n                <a href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EC%A0%95%EC%8B%A0%EA%B1%B4%EA%B0%95-%EB%B0%8F-%EC%95%BD%EB%AC%BC%EC%B9%98%EB%A3%8C%2Findex.html\">정신건강 및 약물치료</a>\n              </h4>\n              <p>범죄로 인한 형을 선고 받을 경우 정신질환이 이에 어떤 영향을 미치는지 설명하고 있습니다.\n</p><div class=\"project-link\">\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-en\" href=\"https://stepstojustice.ca/legal-topic/criminal-law/mental-health-court-and-drug-treatment-court/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<span>원문보기</span>\n</a>\n</div><p></p>\n              <!--  project btn start  \\-->\n              <a class=\"grop-btn grop-btn_overly grop-vpjct_btn\" href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EC%A0%95%EC%8B%A0%EA%B1%B4%EA%B0%95-%EB%B0%8F-%EC%95%BD%EB%AC%BC%EC%B9%98%EB%A3%8C%2Findex.html\">\n                <span>View Project</span>\n              </a><!--/end-->\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n                <div class=\"grop-filter_single_col  grop-projctfilter_col bpw-col-2 category-6 \">\n          <div class=\"grop-projct_itm_warp\">\n            <!--project Media box start \\-->\n            <div class=\"grop-projct_media_box\">\n              <a class=\"grop-cause_media_img\" href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EC%B2%B4%ED%8F%AC%EC%99%80-%EA%B5%AC%EA%B8%88%2Findex.html\">\n                <img src=\"./archive/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/%EC%B2%B4%ED%8F%AC%EC%99%80-360x234.jpg\" alt=\"체포와 구금\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              </a>\n\n            </div><!--/end-->\n\n            <!--project content text start \\-->\n            <div class=\"grop-projct_content_warp\">\n              <h4>\n                <a href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EC%B2%B4%ED%8F%AC%EC%99%80-%EA%B5%AC%EA%B8%88%2Findex.html\">체포와 구금</a>\n              </h4>\n              <p>경찰에 체포, 구금 및 구속될 시 발생가능한 상황과 권리를 설명하고 있습니다.\n</p><div class=\"project-link\">\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-en\" href=\"https://stepstojustice.ca/legal-topic/criminal-law/rights-of-arrested-persons/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<span>원문보기</span>\n</a>\n</div><p></p>\n              <!--  project btn start  \\-->\n              <a class=\"grop-btn grop-btn_overly grop-vpjct_btn\" href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EC%B2%B4%ED%8F%AC%EC%99%80-%EA%B5%AC%EA%B8%88%2Findex.html\">\n                <span>View Project</span>\n              </a><!--/end-->\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n                <div class=\"grop-filter_single_col  grop-projctfilter_col bpw-col-2 category-6 \">\n          <div class=\"grop-projct_itm_warp\">\n            <!--project Media box start \\-->\n            <div class=\"grop-projct_media_box\">\n              <a class=\"grop-cause_media_img\" href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%ED%94%BC%ED%95%B4%EC%9E%90%EC%99%80-%EB%AA%A9%EA%B2%A9%EC%9E%90%2Findex.html\">\n                <img src=\"./archive/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/%ED%94%BC%ED%95%B4%EC%9E%90%EC%99%80-%EB%AA%A9%EA%B2%A9%EC%9E%90-360x234.jpg\" alt=\"피해자와 목격자\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              </a>\n\n            </div><!--/end-->\n\n            <!--project content text start \\-->\n            <div class=\"grop-projct_content_warp\">\n              <h4>\n                <a href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%ED%94%BC%ED%95%B4%EC%9E%90%EC%99%80-%EB%AA%A9%EA%B2%A9%EC%9E%90%2Findex.html\">피해자와 목격자</a>\n              </h4>\n              <p></p><div class=\"project-link\">\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-en\" href=\"https://stepstojustice.ca/legal-topic/criminal-law/victims-and-witnesses/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<span>원문보기</span>\n</a>\n</div><p></p>\n              <!--  project btn start  \\-->\n              <a class=\"grop-btn grop-btn_overly grop-vpjct_btn\" href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%ED%94%BC%ED%95%B4%EC%9E%90%EC%99%80-%EB%AA%A9%EA%B2%A9%EC%9E%90%2Findex.html\">\n                <span>View Project</span>\n              </a><!--/end-->\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n                <div class=\"grop-filter_single_col  grop-projctfilter_col bpw-col-2 category-2 \">\n          <div class=\"grop-projct_itm_warp\">\n            <!--project Media box start \\-->\n            <div class=\"grop-projct_media_box\">\n              <a class=\"grop-cause_media_img\" href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EC%B6%9C%EC%83%9D%EA%B3%BC-%EC%9E%85%EC%96%91%2Findex.html\">\n                <img src=\"./archive/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/book_family_5ccustodyAccess-360x234.jpg\" alt=\"출생과 입양\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              </a>\n\n            </div><!--/end-->\n\n            <!--project content text start \\-->\n            <div class=\"grop-projct_content_warp\">\n              <h4>\n                <a href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EC%B6%9C%EC%83%9D%EA%B3%BC-%EC%9E%85%EC%96%91%2Findex.html\">출생과 입양</a>\n              </h4>\n              <p>법원에 가지않고도 배우자와 문제를 해결할 수 있습니다. 당신은 스스로 배우자와 문제에 대해 의논하여 합의점에 도달하거나, 둘다 신뢰할 수 있는 사람의 도움을 받아 합의를 볼 수 도 있습니다. 변호사를 선임하거나 가정법에 전문가인 조정자 또는 중재자를 통하여서 도움을 받을 수 도 있습니다.\n</p><div class=\"project-link\">\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-en\" href=\"https://stepstojustice.ca/legal-topic/family-law/birth-and-adoption/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<span>원문보기</span>\n</a>\n</div><p></p>\n              <!--  project btn start  \\-->\n              <a class=\"grop-btn grop-btn_overly grop-vpjct_btn\" href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%EC%B6%9C%EC%83%9D%EA%B3%BC-%EC%9E%85%EC%96%91%2Findex.html\">\n                <span>View Project</span>\n              </a><!--/end-->\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n                <div class=\"grop-filter_single_col  grop-projctfilter_col bpw-col-2 category-2 \">\n          <div class=\"grop-projct_itm_warp\">\n            <!--project Media box start \\-->\n            <div class=\"grop-projct_media_box\">\n              <a class=\"grop-cause_media_img\" href=\"#/page?file=lawbook-item%2F%ED%98%BC%EC%9D%B8%